Ian and Yasuhisa.  Felix, as I understand it, is already on the platform.

So with that, all I have to say is 'Nice work and Thanks'!

This could be useful.  As these are going to be mostly 'one-way'
communications (i.e.: status updates), a blog seems quite appropriate.  I
have no strong feelings as to whether we should or should not have open
comments or not.

But just to reiterate: of course nobody is forced to participate and blog, it
is simply a nice 'mechanism' for everybody to keep mindful of timelines and
to actually get stuff done by certain key dates (e.g. 'next blog post').

Not that I have any doubt it wouldn't get done otherwise but we do believe in
openness and communication. So there.  ;-)

